ORIGINAL Minimal Reproducible Example authored for tree-sitter-cmd.

File:           mre-classpath-builder.bat
Provenance:     Original work, part of this repository (no third party).
SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
Copyright (c) tree-sitter-cmd contributors

This MRE distills the cmd idioms of JVM launcher classpath builders such as Gradle/Kafka wrapper scripts and EPL-licensed tools like deps.clj, whose upstream license
(EPL-1.0 / Apache-2.0 (mixed)) prevents vendoring the real file verbatim. No third-party text is
reproduced; it exists as an independent zero-ERROR parse-regression case for:
  - FOR /F `usebackq` over a back-quoted command
  - accumulating into a delayed-expansion variable across a loop
  - `if ERRORLEVEL` handling and `2>nul` redirection in a block
